   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Development Education for journalists and the public</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Glob&#xe1;lne rozvojov&#xe9; vzdel&#xe1;vanie pre novin&#xe1;rov a verejnos&#x165;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project brings innovation into GE initiative World between the Lines, aiming to get more complex information on development into Slovak discourse. Main objective of the project is to raise awareness on GE issues by increasing the quality and quantity of education of (future) journalists (via university courses including innovative MOOC course + courses of lifelong learning), and by activities of informal education (via media outputs including GE-focused podcasts and festival discussions)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Projekt je pokra&#x10d;ovan&#xed;m a inov&#xe1;ciou GRV iniciat&#xed;vy Svet medzi riadkami, ktorej cie&#x13e;om je dosta&#x165; viac komplexn&#xfd;ch inform&#xe1;ci&#xed; o rozvoji do slovensk&#xe9;ho diskurzu. Hlavn&#xfd;m cie&#x13e;om projektu je roz&#x161;&#xed;ri&#x165; povedomie verejnosti o GRV t&#xe9;mach a s&#xfa;vislostiach zv&#xfd;&#x161;en&#xed;m kvality a kvantity vzdel&#xe1;vania (bud&#xfa;cich) novin&#xe1;rov a novin&#xe1;riek (prostredn&#xed;ctvom vysoko&#x161;kolsk&#xfd;ch kurzov vr&#xe1;tane inovat&#xed;vneho MOOC kurzu a kurzov celo&#x17e;ivotn&#xe9;ho vzdel&#xe1;vania) a sprievodn&#xfd;mi aktivitami inform&#xe1;lneho vzdel&#xe1;vania (prostredn&#xed;ctvom medi&#xe1;lnych v&#xfd;stupov vr&#xe1;tane na GRV zameran&#xfd;ch podcastov a festivalov&#xfd;ch diskusi&#xed;).</narrative>
  </description>
